@startuml
left to right direction

rectangle "Action Creator" as ActionCreator
rectangle "Dispatcher" as Dispatcher
rectangle "Store" as Store
rectangle "View" as View
rectangle "Action" as Action

ActionCreator -down-> Dispatcher : Creates Action
Dispatcher -down-> Store : Dispatches Action
Store -down-> View : Updates State
View -down-> Action : Triggers Action

Action -right-> Dispatcher : Sends Action
@enduml